<title>USA: Nalco Chemical to acquire Nutmeg Tech.</title>
<headline>Nalco Chemical to acquire Nutmeg Tech.</headline>
<dateline>NAPERVILLE, Ill. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nalco Chemical Co said Friday it signed a letter of intent to acquire assets of privately held Nutmeg Technologies Inc, a Connecticut-based water treatment company.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The regional company expects to have 1996 sales of about $9 million.</p>
<p>Nalco Chemical manufactures water treatment and process chemicals and services.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
